@startuml
title MaquiControl - Profiles Management Bounded Context\nDesign-Level Event Storming

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangleFontSize 12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #BDB76B
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

' ===== Actor -> Command -> Aggregate -> Domain Event =====
rectangle "COMMAND\nCreate Profile" as CMD_CREATE_PROFILE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nProfile" as AGG_PROFILE_0 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nProfile Created" as EVT_PROFILE_CREATED #FFB74D
rectangle "COMMAND\nUpdate Profile" as CMD_UPDATE_PROFILE #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nProfile" as AGG_PROFILE_1 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nProfile Updated" as EVT_PROFILE_UPDATED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_USER_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nRegister Organization" as CMD_REGISTER_ORGANIZATION #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nOrganization" as AGG_ORGANIZATION_2 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nOrganization Registered" as EVT_ORGANIZATION_REGISTERED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_USER_2 #FFF9C4
rectangle "COMMAND\nUpdate Organization" as CMD_UPDATE_ORGANIZATION #87CEFA
rectangle "AGGREGATE\nOrganization" as AGG_ORGANIZATION_3 #FFF59D
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT\nOrganization Updated" as EVT_ORGANIZATION_UPDATED #FFB74D
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_USER_3 #FFF9C4

' ===== Policies =====
rectangle "DOMAIN EVENT (Identity & Access)\nUser Signed Up" as XEVT_USER_SIGNED_UP #FFE0B2
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a user signs up,\ncreate the profile of the account" as POL_0 #B39DDB
rectangle "POLICY\nWhen a profile is created,\nask for its organization data" as POL_1 #B39DDB

' ===== Read Models =====
rectangle "READ MODEL\nProfile Details\n<size:10><i>Query: View Profile</i></size>" as RM_0 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_RM_0 #FFF9C4
rectangle "READ MODEL\nOrganization Details\n<size:10><i>Query: View Organization</i></size>" as RM_1 #81C784
rectangle "ACTOR\nUser" as ACT_RM_1 #FFF9C4
rectangle "HOTSPOT\nThe RUC is not yet verified\nagainst SUNAT" as HOT_0 #EF9A9A

CMD_CREATE_PROFILE --> AGG_PROFILE_0
AGG_PROFILE_0 --> EVT_PROFILE_CREATED
note bottom of AGG_PROFILE_0
<b>Business rules (Profile)</b>
- First name and last name are required
- Document number is required
- Contact information requires valid
  phone, email and address
end note
ACT_USER_1 --> CMD_UPDATE_PROFILE
CMD_UPDATE_PROFILE --> AGG_PROFILE_1
AGG_PROFILE_1 --> EVT_PROFILE_UPDATED
ACT_USER_2 --> CMD_REGISTER_ORGANIZATION
CMD_REGISTER_ORGANIZATION --> AGG_ORGANIZATION_2
AGG_ORGANIZATION_2 --> EVT_ORGANIZATION_REGISTERED
note bottom of AGG_ORGANIZATION_2
<b>Business rules (Organization)</b>
- Legal name, tax id (RUC) and
  address are required
- Tax id must be valid
end note
ACT_USER_3 --> CMD_UPDATE_ORGANIZATION
CMD_UPDATE_ORGANIZATION --> AGG_ORGANIZATION_3
AGG_ORGANIZATION_3 --> EVT_ORGANIZATION_UPDATED
XEVT_USER_SIGNED_UP --> POL_0
POL_0 --> CMD_CREATE_PROFILE
EVT_PROFILE_CREATED --> POL_1
POL_1 --> CMD_REGISTER_ORGANIZATION
EVT_PROFILE_CREATED ..> RM_0 : updates
EVT_PROFILE_UPDATED ..> RM_0 : updates
RM_0 ..> ACT_RM_0 : informs
EVT_ORGANIZATION_REGISTERED ..> RM_1 : updates
EVT_ORGANIZATION_UPDATED ..> RM_1 : updates
RM_1 ..> ACT_RM_1 : informs
HOT_0 .. EVT_ORGANIZATION_REGISTERED

legend right
|= Color |= Element |
|<#FFF9C4>| Actor |
|<#87CEFA>| Command |
|<#FFF59D>| Aggregate |
|<#FFB74D>| Domain Event |
|<#B39DDB>| Policy |
|<#81C784>| Read Model |
|<#FFE0B2>| Domain Event from another Bounded Context |
|<#EF9A9A>| Hotspot |
|<#FFFDE7>| Business Rules (note) |
endlegend

@enduml
